sequenceDiagram
    participant Sensor
    participant Ingest as MQTT + Telegraf
    participant TS as InfluxDB
    participant Eval as One-shot evaluator
    participant DB as DynamoDB domain
    participant Relay
    participant Worker as Channel queue + worker
    participant Provider as SES / Telegram
    participant User
    participant API as Authorized API
    Sensor->>Ingest: Synthetic observations
    Ingest->>TS: Context-enriched window
    Eval->>TS: Query complete valid window
    Eval->>DB: Atomic incident + outbox
    Relay->>DB: Claim eligible outbox / Delivery
    Relay->>Worker: Durable IDs per channel
    Worker->>DB: Fenced Attempt / preflight
    Worker->>Provider: Fake delivery call
    Provider-->>Worker: Accepted / retryable / permanent / unknown
    Worker->>DB: Durable result
    Note over Provider,User: Provider acceptance is NOT a read receipt
    Provider-->>User: Illustrative message on mock device
    User->>API: Open incident, authenticated
    API->>DB: Check membership and read incident
    User->>API: Acknowledge expectedVersion
    API->>DB: Record acknowledgment, not recovery
    Eval->>TS: Later valid clean window
    Eval->>DB: Recovery + correlated eligible outbox
    Relay->>Worker: Recovery work
    Worker->>Provider: Independent channel calls
    Provider-->>User: Recovery message in demo
